# Flutter Grocery UI

A Flutter practice project based on a Figma design.

## Overview
This project demonstrates my ability to convert a Figma design into a Flutter user interface.

### Features
- Welcome screen
- Navigation to a Sign In screen
- Clean widget structure
- Asset management

### Technologies
- Flutter
- Dart
- Material Design
- Figma

> Note: This is a UI practice project. The Sign In screen is currently a placeholder and authentication is not implemented yet.
